refused: d277_a_let_writes_its_type.cy:4:16, line 4 column 16
 4 |     let $count set_to 0;
   |                ^^^^^^
 what: this `let` doesn't write its type
 why:  every `let` and `const` writes its type, so a reader never has to work one out, and there's no type inference in the base language (D277)
